{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/革命风暴","pageid":9004,"revid":22085,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%9D%A9%E5%91%BD%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%9D%A9%E5%91%BD%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%9D%A9%E5%91%BD%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>革命风暴</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E9.9D.A9.E5.91.BD.E9.A3.8E.E6.9A.B4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"革命风暴\"><b>革命风暴</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 革命风暴.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/65/0ej7w1gy3ho9pwuzo7thb6h3qglknit.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%9D%A9%E5%91%BD%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/65/0ej7w1gy3ho9pwuzo7thb6h3qglknit.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%9D%A9%E5%91%BD%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/65/0ej7w1gy3ho9pwuzo7thb6h3qglknit.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />革命风暴\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-5\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>十字3(宽5)\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓5-↑5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（支援）选择<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>名拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"质疑之种\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">质疑之种</font></span></span>]的目标，使其十字周围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格（宽5格）内所有敌人朝中心击退<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格；若携带技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">神,不过虚妄！</font></span>]（需可释放），则自动释放其效果。<br />✦附属被动，效果：行动结束并进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"警戒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">警戒</font></span></span>]时，获得光环，效果：所有处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"质疑之种\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">质疑之种</font></span></span>]警戒范围内的敌人受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透易伤2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透易伤2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼伤害2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼伤害2</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼穿透伤害2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">▼穿透伤害2</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-5 十字3(宽5).png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5f/n2k7k6dmy68nv8rop9somxcwth1b6ym.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5_%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%973%28%E5%AE%BD5%29.png.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5f/n2k7k6dmy68nv8rop9somxcwth1b6ym.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5_%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%973%28%E5%AE%BD5%29.png.jpeg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5f/n2k7k6dmy68nv8rop9somxcwth1b6ym.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5_%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%973%28%E5%AE%BD5%29.png.jpeg 2x\" data-file-width=\"200\" data-file-height=\"200\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%AE